# ENV-1 (Phase 7). `core.autocrlf=true` on this machine checked every text file
# out with CRLF while Git stored LF, so `pnpm format:check` reported 98 files as
# unformatted when the only difference was the line ending. Prettier defaults to
# `endOfLine: "lf"`, so the honest fix is to check the worktree out the way the
# repository already stores it rather than to relax the formatter.
#
# No stored blob changes: every tracked text file was already LF in Git.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary, so Git never inspects or converts them.
*.png    binary
*.jpg    binary
*.jpeg   binary
*.webp   binary
*.gif    binary
*.ico    binary
*.webm   binary
*.mp4    binary
*.woff   binary
*.woff2  binary
*.ttf    binary
*.otf    binary
*.pdf    binary
*.bundle binary
